00:45:03.318 --> 00:45:07.485
but also surprise and delight
those potential customers.

00:45:08.673 --> 00:45:11.336
Essentially these corporations
that have these charitable

00:45:11.336 --> 00:45:14.044
contributions to give in
a way that makes sense

00:45:14.044 --> 00:45:15.509
for a nonprofit.

00:45:15.509 --> 00:45:17.635
- [Gary] I want to make sure
I'm following this right.

00:45:17.635 --> 00:45:18.974
Give me a little bit more context.

00:45:18.974 --> 00:45:20.171
