and there's also a value

00:45:38.442 --> 00:45:39.497
to these companies.

00:45:39.497 --> 00:45:41.230
- [Gary] I see and what
those employees are doing

00:45:41.230 --> 00:45:43.388
is actually something charitable?

00:45:43.388 --> 00:45:44.348
- Yes.

00:45:44.348 --> 00:45:47.294
- [Gary] Right, so you're not
taking them to softball games.

00:45:47.294 --> 00:45:48.538
That group is team building around

00:45:48.538 --> 00:45:50.507
doing something charitable.
- Exactly.

00:45:50.507 --> 00:45:51.421
So the organization almost thinks

00:45:51.421 --> 00:45:53.121
