00:47:02.819 --> 00:47:05.008
Let's eliminate the romance.

00:47:05.008 --> 00:47:06.396
Don't tell me the fluff.

00:47:06.396 --> 00:47:08.962
Tell me that I'm gonna save $17,000 a year

00:47:08.962 --> 00:47:12.411
